{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["Every bed whereon he who has the discharge lies — even if it is under a stone and he did not touch it at all. The bottom line: a zav, a zavah, and a nidah all impart a severe impurity to what is beneath them, to defile a person and garments. This applies if the objects beneath him are designated for sitting, even though he did not touch them at all."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:49.792856648Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}